  ! This import is defined outside of a cascade layer.
  
    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
  > 2 │ @import "foo.css";
      │  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ 
    4 │ p {
  
  i Imported styles without a cascade layer always take precedence over layered styles, which makes the cascade harder to predict and override.
  
  i Add the layer keyword after the import to control its place in the cascade.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

